<section class="section market-section">
  <div class="market-ambient" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="market-blob market-blob-a"></span>
    <span class="market-blob market-blob-b"></span>
    <svg class="market-noise" viewBox="0 0 1600 900" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="marketLines" x="0" y="0" width="80" height="80" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <line x1="0" y1="40" x2="80" y2="40" stroke="rgba(255, 176, 102, 0.04)" stroke-width="1"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="1600" height="900" fill="url(#marketLines)"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal market-header">
      <div class="section-kicker">The Market is Changing</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The next advantage will not come from <span class="grad-text">doing more</span>.</h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="market-statements">
      <li class="market-statement reveal">
        <span class="market-stmt-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <p>The market is becoming louder. Attention is becoming shorter.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="market-statement reveal">
        <span class="market-stmt-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <p>Technology is making execution easier. Differentiation harder.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="market-statement reveal">
        <span class="market-stmt-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <p>Brands are no longer competing only on visibility. They are competing on <strong>interpretation</strong>.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="market-statement reveal">
        <span class="market-stmt-num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <p>Consumers forget campaigns quickly. They remember consistent meaning over time.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="market-statement reveal">
        <span class="market-stmt-num" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <p>More communication does not always create stronger positioning.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="market-statement market-statement-end reveal">
        <span class="market-stmt-num" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
        <p>It will come from <strong>understanding better</strong>.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
